# =========================
# Precipitation radar archive
# =========================
# ~980 MB of hourly tenki.jp JPEGs (~620 MB/year) plus the downloader's log.
# Keep them on disk — they are what lets the grids be re-derived when the colour
# table changes — but they are source data, not source code.
dev-helpers/precipication-collector/images/
dev-helpers/precipication-collector/download_log.csv
dev-helpers/precipication-collector/cron.log
